u in your environment",[539,546,549,555,562,569,576,578,585,588,595],{"_99":540,"_106":116,"_101":541,"_110":542,"_119":-7,"_13":543,"_121":544},"en:deployment/overview.mdx","Deploy Lamassu","Choose the operating model that fits your infrastructure and control requirements.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/deployment/overview",{"_123":545},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_99":547,"_106":144,"_119":-7,"_101":548},"en:_12","Kubernetes self-managed",{"_99":550,"_106":116,"_101":548,"_110":551,"_119":-7,"_13":552,"_121":553},"en:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Choose an installation workflow and network architecture for Lamassu on your Kubernetes cluster.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_123":554},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_99":556,"_106":116,"_101":557,"_110":558,"_119":-7,"_13":559,"_121":560},"en:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Install with Helm","Prepare dependencies, configure the Lamassu chart and verify a controlled Kubernetes deployment.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_123":561},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_99":563,"_106":116,"_101":564,"_110":565,"_119":-7,"_13":566,"_121":567},"en:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expose the Gateway","Choose how clients reach Lamassu, when to set gateway.addresses and how to design multiple Gateways.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_123":568},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_99":570,"_106":116,"_101":571,"_110":572,"_119":-7,"_13":573,"_121":574},"en:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Bootstrap a complete Lamassu evaluation or lab environment on an existing Kubernetes cluster.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_123":575},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_99":577,"_106":144,"_119":-7,"_101":70},"en:_13",{"_99":579,"_106":116,"_101":580,"_110":581,"_119":-7,"_13":582,"_121":583},"en:deployment/troubleshooting.mdx","Deployment troubleshooting","Diagnose access, service